    "show_share": true,
    "description": "As the media and communications landscape continues to undergo unprecedented transformation driven by technological advancements and changing audience behaviours, the role of the role of communicators in any organization has become pivotal. To address this, the Aga Khan University Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC) has launched two executive education courses in the media and communications field. The courses dubbed, ' Media Engagement for Impact ' and ' Strategic Digital Communications' , aim to equip participants with the knowledge and skills to leverage the power for positive change and to navigate the fast-paced world of digital communications.",
